==Notes==
[[image:Pale_Master.jpg|thumb=Pale_Master_Arm.jpg|alt=Pale master's arm|A pale master with the skeletal arm from this feat]]
*Requires [[Hordes of the Underdark]].
*This ability requires a successful melee [[touch attack]]. If the touch attack fails to hit, no uses per day of this feat are consumed.
*If the touch attack hits, a [[fortitude]] [[saving throw]] vs. negative energy is allowed to avoid the effects with a [[difficulty class|DC]] of 14 + (pale master level)/2.
*The paralysis lasts for [[d6]] + 2 [[round]]s.
*[[Elf|Elves]] are immune to this attack.
*Upon gaining this feat, the character's arm will by default become skeletal.

